WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.550
The light-Bushin prerequisite knocks Ryu down near the wall.

2
00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:00.950
Crouching light punch intentionally whiffs during wake-up.

3
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:01.500
Standing heavy kick hits the waking Ryu.

4
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Standing medium punch links into the heavy-punch target.

5
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.500
Sprint slide extends the conversion.

6
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.650
Light Bushin completes the near-corner juggle.

7
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:05.300
Ryu lands after the completed conversion.
